🧩42. Important Business Logic
The application contains several important business rules.
Rule 1 — Property Approval
A newly added owner property is not immediately visible to clients.
Owner Adds Property
 ↓
Pending
 ↓
Admin Approval
 ↓
Visible to Client
Rule 2 — Favorites Are Database-Driven
Adding or removing favorites updates the database.
Rule 3 — Inquiry Requires a Valid Property
The transcript demonstrates that demo/initialized properties that are not associated with an owner
cannot be used for an inquiry.
Rule 4 — Negotiation Has Multiple States
Active
 ↓
Negotiating
 ↓
Agreed
 ↓
Purchased
Rule 5 — Admin Has Approval Authority
Only the admin can approve properties.
Rule 6 — Different Roles Have Different Permissions
Client, owner/agent, and admin have different responsibilities.
