🎯57. Interview Explanation — Short Version
"Explain this project."
This is a full-stack real estate booking application developed using React, Spring Boot, and
MySQL. The application supports three major roles: client, owner/agent, and admin. Clients can
search and filter properties, add favorites, view locations using Google Maps, interact with an
AI property recommendation assistant, submit inquiries, negotiate with owners, and complete
purchases. Owners can add and manage properties and respond to client inquiries. Properties
added by owners first go through an admin approval process before becoming visible to clients.
The application uses WebSocket for real-time chat and notifications and integrates Razorpay
for payments. The admin dashboard provides user management, property approvals, inquiry
management, real-time analytics, and PDF export. The project also contains AI assistants and
speech-to-text functionality.
